    "title": "Watch: U.S. golf star chuckles at Bryson DeChambeau dig during Presidents Cup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Smith ,\n21 hours ago Bryson DeChambeau was not at Medinah for the opening day of the Presidents Cup, but the two-time U.S. Open champion still managed to make an appearance of sorts. A spectator watching Sam Burns during Thursday's opening matches invoked DeChambeau while Burns prepared to play a shot from the rough, drawing a laugh from the American. Read full article",
